@startuml Sum_Ssfm_LinBusOff_Handler_SeqDiag

participant Dem as Dem
participant LNM as LNM
participant SUSD as SUSD
participant SWC as SWC
participant RTE as RTE
box SUM_SSFM
    participant Sum_Ssfm_ExecutionManager as ExecutionManager
    participant Sum_Ssfm_LinBusOff_Handler as LinBusoff
end box

activate LinBusoff
group LIN Bus off Sequence of each configured <Lin_network>
LNM -> LinBusoff: Data event Lin Bus off changed
LinBusoff->LinBusoff: Trigger Runnable_SSFM_LNM_LIN_Busoff_<n>
alt (No OBD Support and voltage in range) or (OBD Support and not under voltage)
    LinBusoff -> SUSD: Ask for battery voltage range
    SUSD --> LinBusoff
    LinBusoff ->ExecutionManager: Ask for battery voltage Recovery Timer flag
    ExecutionManager --> LinBusoff
    LinBusoff ->ExecutionManager: Ask for Reset Power Up Recovery Timer flag
    ExecutionManager --> LinBusoff    
    LinBusoff -> Dem: Set/Reset related Dem events based on reception of notification from LNM
end
end
deactivate LinBusoff

@enduml 